# Send these from VS Code with the REST Client extension ("Send Request" above each block).
# Only the open routes: every POST needs a BRC-103 signed request (AuthFetch), so it cannot be sent from here.
@base = http://localhost:8787
@group = group-xxx

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Services
GET {{base}}/api/services

### Intents
GET {{base}}/api/intents

### Groups
GET {{base}}/api/groups

### One group
GET {{base}}/api/groups/{{group}}

### Its settlement
GET {{base}}/api/groups/{{group}}/settlement

### Live feed
GET {{base}}/api/feed
